---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro'
import Heading from '../components/Heading.astro'
import Card from '../components/Card.astro'

const title = 'Arnor Heidar Sigurdsson'
---

<MainLayout title={title}>
  <article>
    <Heading tag="h1" variation="semi">{title}</Heading>

    <p>
      I am a software developer and designer hailing from Iceland. Currently CTO at <a
        href="https://purenorth.is"
        target="_blank">Pure North</a
      >
      where we're working to improve the environment by recycling plastics and bringing the value of
      recycling back to the consumer.
    </p>

    <p>
      Previously I was the technical director at <a target="_blank" href="https://www.juni.is"
        >Júní</a
      >, a digital transformation agency in Iceland.
    </p>

    <p>
      Before that I had a 4 year stint as a developer and the lead designer at a venture backed
      growth-related startup in San Francisco.
    </p>

    <div class="w-8/12 my-6">
      <Card>
        <h2 class="mb-3 mt-0 text-4xl font-bold">arnorhs</h2>
        <ul class="my-0">
          <li>Bluesky: <a href="https://bsky.app/profile/arnorhs.dev">@arnorhs.dev</a></li>
          <li>LinkedIn: <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/arnorhs">/in/arnorhs</a></li>
          <li>Github: <a href="https://github.com/arnorhs">github.com/arnorhs</a></li>
          <li>Website: <a href="https://arnorhs.dev">arnorhs.dev</a></li>
          <li>NPM: <a href="https://www.npmjs.com/~arnorhs">~arnorhs</a></li>
          <li>E-mail: <a href="mailto:arnorhs@gmail.com">arnorhs@gmail.com</a></li>
        </ul>
      </Card>
    </div>

    <Heading tag="h2">Interests and hobbies</Heading>

    <ul>
      <li>Software development - It probably goes without saying</li>
      <li>
        Making music - Both electonic music, instrumentalist, love making songs and beats, played in
        bands, etc
      </li>
      <li>Analog modular music and designing my own circuits, soldering etc</li>
      <li>
        Rock climbing - I was an avid rock climber for a few years, and visited many places around
        the world for rock climbing
      </li>
      <li>Video games, chess, speedcubing</li>
    </ul>
  </article>
</MainLayout>
